OL,5,G0200 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FThe home brew causes friction
OL,7,     Famong the women. Clara gets
OL,8,     Fpermission to have a birthday
OL,9,     Fparty. Col Burke's siege
OL,10,     Fcontinues, but he doesn't know
OL,11,     Fwhat to do next.
OL,12,G0305 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FThe police turn up at Val's place
OL,14,     Fand arrest Bea, returning her to
OL,15,     FWentworth where she is welcomed
OL,16,     Fback by Doreen. Monnie is still
OL,17,     Fadamant she's in charge.
OL,18,G0400 Teleshopping
